WEBVTT

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:11.980
Intrigue in the Bakumatsu

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.840
Tsukikage kooru daichi wo

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:33.670
Korogari fumiwakete yuku

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:40.880
Horobi to saisei no jidai ga hajimaru

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:44.550
Jiyuu wo omoku kakagete

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:48.120
Michinaki michi wo erande

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:55.230
Mahiru yori mabushii nichibotsu wo koete

00:00:55.230 --> 00:01:02.230
Yume wo kataru you ni toki no fune wa yuku

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:11.340
Sono yamiji no mukou ni atarashii yoake

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:19.250
Bokura wa kitto kurayami no kaina kara umarete kita

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:22.790
Kanawanu koi wo suruyou ni

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:26.760
Hikari e to samayotteku

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:32.000
Doko made mo hateshino nai kono michi wo

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:37.490
Kaeru sube wa nai

00:02:23.420 --> 00:02:24.710
Absolutely pathetic...

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:27.750
You should be ashamed.

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:34.960
Did you just give that look to Her Majesty?

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:38.400
A bunch of useless bastards, the lot of you.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:42.160
As of today you're relieved of your duty.

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:48.570
Knight and the other two will return to England
after stopping at Hong Kong with this fleet.

00:02:48.670 --> 00:02:49.770
And you, sir...

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:53.170
You do whatever you like.

00:02:55.480 --> 00:03:00.510
I should never have put someone
like you in charge of the mission.

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:05.120
Damn it all...

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:08.630
I'm very disappointed in you.

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:14.960
You disloyal bat.

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:56.440
I'm sorry.

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:04.940
The one who died is to be blamed.

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:07.510
Then why do you cry?

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:09.550
The pain...

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:13.020
My body is torn apart...

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:18.360
It's so painful... Painful...

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:21.790
I didn't realize that you two were siblings.

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:25.130
It was just the two of us from the beginning.

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:29.940
We were from the slums of London,
just orphans...

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:32.310
I didn't even know the meaning
of having a sibling...

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:37.100
I just always thought that we
completed each other...

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:43.110
He was always with me
even when he went off to battle...

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:47.290
And I was with him when I was away...

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:49.920
But now my brother is gone.

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:52.560
I can clearly see that...

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:56.860
It's not about being alone or being together...

00:04:57.740 --> 00:04:59.400
It just hurts...

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:03.570
I'm beyond feeling pain.

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:28.290
The Queen wrote me off, too...

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:33.170
Maybe I'm crying?

00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:37.110
No.

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:39.010
Guess not.

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:44.840
What happened?

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.480
Nothing.

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:50.110
It's nothing...

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:53.980
I have nothing now...

00:06:01.370 --> 00:06:03.430
Let me share the pain with you.

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:48.410
This is the only thing that's left for us now.

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:51.910
You know I'm ready.

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:01.230
Let's go kill Enomoto.

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:18.270
All hail Enomoto!

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:21.480
He said, "the Republic,
one of the finest in the world"!

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:25.040
Tokugawa? Satsuma-Choshin?
They can kiss my butt!

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:29.910
I can't wait to see that beautiful Kakunojo again!

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:32.920
"I won't run away!"

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:34.520
"I will fight!"

00:07:35.630 --> 00:07:39.090
I don't know what it is,
but it gets me all excited inside!

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:04.550
My body isn't going to hold out
if they keep on sending us out there!

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:11.330
We still can't find that man who's dressed
in black. It's hard to believe he's in the city.

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:11.330
- AGE 17~18
- HEIGHT ABOUT 170 CM
- DRESSED IN BLACK

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:38.250
What's going on?

00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:44.950
I came to talk to Enomoto-dono, but...
Is this a bad time?

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:47.590
Nonsense. Of course not...

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:50.360
Well then. I've got to get going.

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:57.940
I've been made aware that several suspicious
persons have been in and out of Goryokaku,

00:08:57.940 --> 00:09:01.000
but is that something you need to hide from me?

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:07.820
Let him see it.

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:13.420
Isn't it about time to reveal
everything to Hijikata, too?

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:15.420
I guess the time is now.

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:17.850
I'll show you.

00:09:34.180 --> 00:09:35.700
Please wait for a moment.

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:45.380
What is this?

00:09:52.430 --> 00:09:56.200
This is also one of the ideas
that Enomoto has for the Republic.

00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:59.670
Did you create such an
unimaginable thing like this?

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:00.700
Indeed so.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:03.710
I'm asking my comrade Enomoto a question!

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:10.010
Don't tell me you created this Enomoto-dono!

00:10:12.650 --> 00:10:16.210
Do you mean to tell me I'm a fake?

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:17.480
Skull...

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:21.750
You're not the real Enomoto-dono!

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:29.460
Either way, he's still Enomoto-dono.

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:33.460
He's just got another head on him.

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:53.350
Hijikata-dono, I'm sure you've already heard
about it. About the Head of the Conqueror.

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:55.460
"The Head of the Conqueror"?

00:10:55.460 --> 00:11:02.200
That's right. It's the cursed head of a man
beheaded for opposing Emperor Shi Huangdi.

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:08.110
It was eventually brought to
Japan by the Hermit Jofuku.

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:12.710
For over 2000 years,
people believed that this Head

00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:16.480
has been the cause of all the turbulent
events that this country has faced.

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:23.250
The Head has become the power
that shapes the new world,

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:27.520
guiding this fledgling nation
until she is ready to emerge.

00:11:28.390 --> 00:11:32.120
The Head has been writing
the history of this country.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:37.560
And that very same Head is right now
possessing Enomoto-dono.

00:11:39.100 --> 00:11:44.200
With the power of this Head, I'm sure
Goryokaku will become our solid foundation!

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:47.670
That's nonsense! You've set me up, haven't you?

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:50.850
No ghost can win a war for you!

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:53.080
We will win!

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:55.490
My Republic will win!

00:11:55.490 --> 00:11:57.080
From here in Goryokaku!

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:10.090
My army will not fall!

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:14.370
We'll destroy the New Government Army
and storm onward to the south!

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:16.170
And then we'll seize Edo!

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:20.040
This is the new battleground
I've prepared for you, Hijikata!

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:22.910
And moreover, it will be
a winning battle this time around!

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:26.370
Look!

00:12:37.260 --> 00:12:38.250
What is this?

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:42.890
The world we govern.

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:08.690
Assassin?!

00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:10.590
It seems so.

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:14.120
This happened because of your big ego!
Protect Enomoto-dono!

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:17.060
Why don't you do that?

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:24.970
Why you!

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:30.880
Damn!

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:39.850
The British... They never learn, do they?

00:13:40.530 --> 00:13:42.320
I need no country to serve.

00:13:42.660 --> 00:13:48.120
My sword has been released from duty.
Now I am free to fight as I please!

00:14:09.590 --> 00:14:10.650
I see...

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:33.310
Splendidly done.

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:47.450
Where'd that rat get to?

00:14:57.870 --> 00:15:00.030
Now we've run out of prey.

00:15:01.110 --> 00:15:01.870
What?

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:23.890
Fading dream for you...

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:30.940
Note: Monzaemon Chikamatsu (1653-1724) - A famous and influential
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hplaywright who wrote for bunraku puppet shows

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:29.900
With apologies to Chikamatsu-dono.

00:15:30.640 --> 00:15:33.730
I pity you for the fate you're about to meet.

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:46.610
This is as far as you go.

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:48.590
Enomoto!

00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:51.720
Oh...

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:55.820
Try me.

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:02.460
Why you...

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:13.280
Too bad, boy.

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:15.980
Try here next.

00:16:16.550 --> 00:16:18.070
Aim right here.

00:16:31.600 --> 00:16:34.460
What the hell are you?

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:42.330
This is for my brother!

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:44.040
Take this!

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:48.210
Impossible!

00:16:51.980 --> 00:16:53.380
We don't need your help.

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:55.380
Move! Enomoto-dono is going to be...

00:16:57.720 --> 00:17:04.150
I want you to witness, with your own eyes,
the power of the Head of the Conqueror.

00:17:15.870 --> 00:17:18.140
She'll abandon you again.

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:22.970
Just like your mother abandoned you.

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:31.510
Brother... Brother!

00:17:31.920 --> 00:17:33.120
BROTHER!

00:17:40.900 --> 00:17:41.690
No!

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:47.030
You never forgave her, did you?

00:17:49.510 --> 00:17:51.000
You hate her, don't you?

00:17:51.580 --> 00:17:58.810
There's no way you can forgive your mother
who abandoned you over and over again.

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:17.970
See there? I was right, wasn't I?

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:22.230
That woman abandoned you, too.

00:18:27.610 --> 00:18:31.270
Don't forgive the woman who abandoned you.

00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:37.350
You should kill your mother.

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:44.030
Do it.

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:12.220
What have I done?!

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:54.690
Please forgive me!

00:19:57.030 --> 00:19:58.970
I killed you!

00:20:00.870 --> 00:20:04.330
I... killed you!

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:23.890
You mustn't.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:29.190
Please forgive me!

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:31.370
Forgive my sin...

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:35.460
Mother...

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:43.050
Fight at my side.

00:20:46.280 --> 00:20:47.810
For the Republic!

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:50.440
For the Republic!

00:20:51.360 --> 00:20:53.260
Together!

00:20:57.030 --> 00:20:58.550
For the Republic!

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:21.740
The date of the assault
on Hakodate has been set.

00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:25.440
I see.

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:46.500
The source of the negative aura that you bear.
I've finally found out what it is.

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:02.380
<i>HAKODATE IS RED</i>

00:22:03.560 --> 00:22:09.330
Sono te wa ai no tsurugi

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:18.370
Subete no hajimari no akashi

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:25.100
Hikaru sora no hate

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:30.320
Yume wa mada maboroshi

00:22:31.460 --> 00:22:34.560
Tsuki no akari kage ouyouni hashiru kono michi

00:22:34.560 --> 00:22:42.070
Tsuki no akari kage ouyouni hashiru kono michi

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:47.840
Chigireta ai no tsurugi

00:22:47.840 --> 00:23:00.080
Sashidasu saki wa ikusen no namida ga hitotsu ni nari

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:05.890
Ashita wo kagayakaseru

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:11.600
Kono te wa ai no tsurugi

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:20.300
Subete no hajimari no akashi

00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:47.630
EPISODE 24
IROHANIHOHETO

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:34.820
Enomoto-san! It's me! Hijikata!

00:23:34.820 --> 00:23:37.290
Enomoto-san! It's me! Hijikata!

00:23:38.760 --> 00:23:43.590
The Head of the Conqueror! Time is running out!
I must do something!

00:23:44.900 --> 00:23:48.670
Come forth, Head of the Conqueror!
Come out from my comrade Enomoto!

00:23:47.630 --> 00:24:02.510
IROHANIHOHETO

00:23:48.800 --> 00:23:51.030
I, Hijikata, will destroy you!

00:23:53.700 --> 00:23:54.770
Why you!

00:23:55.070 --> 00:23:59.780
My Izumi no Kami Kanesada and I
aren't enough to kill you?!
